msgctxt "64"
msgid "The press is always hanging around that bar Serena off Tenkaichi Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"If you listen in on their conversations, you'll occasionally hear some "
"juicy gossip you can't hear anywhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "The other day, I heard this amazing story about Minister Suzuki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "What kind of story?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's not for me to say... But if you want to know more, maybe you "
"should stop by Serena yourself. It's on Tenkaichi Street."
msgstr ""

